{"hymn":"S808","parent":"E1305","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"La fe en nuestro Dios hoy hay que declarar","subtitle":"Esperanza de gloria—Prepararnos para el regreso de Cristo","syl":{"n1":"La","n2":"fe","n3":"en","n4":["nues","i"],"n5":["tro","t"],"n6":"Dios","n7":"hoy","n8":"hay","n9":"que","n10":["de","i"],"n11":["cla","m"],"n12":["rar;","t"],"n13":"De","n14":["í","i"],"n15":["do","m"],"n16":["los,","t"],"n17":["vol","i"],"n18":["vi","m"],"n19":["mos","t"],"n20":"al","n21":["vi","i"],"n22":["vien","m"],"n23":["te","t"],"n24":"Dios.","n25":["Mez","i"],"n26":["clan","m"],"n27":["do","t"],"n28":"Su","n29":["Pa","i"],"n30":["la","m"],"n31":["bra","t"],"n32":"con","n33":"fe","n34":"y‿el","n35":["\"¡A","i"],"n36":["mén!\",","t"],"n37":["Vol","i"],"n38":["ve","m"],"n39":["re","m"],"n40":["mos","t"],"n41":"a","n42":["Cris","i"],"n43":["to","t"],"n44":["u","i"],"n45":["na‿y","t"],"n46":["o","i"],"n47":["tra","t"],"n48":"vez.","n50":["La‿o","i"],"n51":["bra","t"],"n52":"de","n53":"fe","n54":"se","n55":["de","i"],"n56":["be","t"],"n57":["au","i"],"n58":["men","m"],"n59":["tar,","t"],"n60":"Y","n61":"el","n62":["tra","i"],"n63":["ba","m"],"n64":["jo","t"],"n65":"de","n66":["a","i"],"n67":["mor","t"],"n68":["de","i"],"n69":["be‿a","m"],"n70":["bun","m"],"n71":["dar;","t"],"n72":"Su","n73":["san","i"],"n74":["ti","m"],"n75":["fi","m"],"n76":["ca","m"],"n77":["ción","t"],"n78":"en","n79":["to","i"],"n80":["dos","t"],"n81":["o","i"],"n82":["bra","m"],"n83":["rá;","t"],"n84":["La‿es","i"],"n85":["pe","m"],"n86":["ran","m"],"n87":["za","t"],"n88":"que‿Él","n89":["vie","i"],"n90":["ne","t"],"n91":"nos","n92":["ha","i"],"n93":["ce","t"],"n94":["ve","i"],"n95":["lar.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Aquí a los hermanos se les brinda amor,","Mas tiene que crecer en toda su expresión.","Que el Señor hoy guíe nuestro corazón","Para que se arraigue en el amor de Dios."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Espíritu, alma y cuerpo Él santificará;","Su novia el Señor así preparará.","Si a Su voz decimos: \"¡Oh Señor, amén!\",","Estaremos ya listos cuando llame Él."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Vendrá nuestro Señor, nos llevará con Él:","¡Tan gloriosa esperanza! ¡Ven, Señor! Amén.","Que pronto en el aire te podamos ver","Y, como hijos del día, tal reunión tener."]}]}